From 5397c82d347d7aecc5cc71c3bddb55231f4e167a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Krish Paul <me@krishnendu.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 04:55:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] VU Meter Player 1.2.0: the Default layout with a level meter

Three layouts in one package, for all four screen sizes. VU Meter Player
has two slim bars under the cover in the theme's accent, with a peak-hold
mark. VU Dial Player has two round dials with needles in their place. VU
Spectrum Player has a ten-band spectrum with falling caps. The player
draws the meters; the layouts only name the widgets, so they are offered
only where the player reports ui.player_layout_meter.

PLUGINS.md documents the meter's widget names for other layouts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
